{"id": "69067", "title": "心有不轨", "author": "正版何奈", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69067.htm", "intro": "时光轰然万物摧毁，唯对你，由始至终心怀不轨\r\n??\r\n\r\n总结版简介：总而言之，这是一个装纯的伪萝莉压迫衣冠禽兽而后被衣冠禽兽反攻上垒吃干抹净的故事。 \r\n\r\n程蔓涨红着脸瞪着眼前正对她耍流氓的某人，“秦淮，你是个变态！” \r\n那人眉头一皱，道，“你说谁？” \r\n“……” \r\n下一刻他好似恍然大悟般，转而望住她，一双清眸似笑非笑，“程蔓小姐，你别告诉我，到现在你还不清楚你男人的名字。” \r\n\r\n\r\n* * \r\n\r\n小简介： \r\n每个成功的凹凸曼背后，都有一只默默奉献的小怪兽。且看小怪兽如何将凹凸曼拆吞入腹。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69067", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "10556367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "程蔓其人", "file": "10556368.html", "available": false}, {"title": "秦师兄", "file": "10556369.html", "available": false}, {"title": "傻妞程蔓", "file": "10556370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我暗恋你很久了", "file": "10556371.html", "available": false}, {"title": "不想再错过你", "file": "10556372.html", "available": false}, {"title": "听说这是巧遇", "file": "10556373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "女追男，隔层纱", "file": "10556374.html", "available": false}, {"title": "拉链没拉", "file": "10556375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我会吃醋", "file": "10556376.html", "available": false}, {"title": "旧时如梦", "file": "10556377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "再见故人", "file": "10556378.html", "available": false}, {"title": "这才叫戏弄（修了几段）", "file": "10556379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "突然的电话", "file": "10556380.html", "available": false}, {"title": "千树万树梨花开", "file": "10556381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "人间绝色", "file": "10556382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "留不住，算不出流年", "file": "10556383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "定情信物？", "file": "10556384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我又不会吃了你", "file": "10556385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "强吻", "file": "10556386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "你死了心吧", "file": "10556387.html", "available": false}, {"title": "扮猪吃老虎", "file": "10556388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "恋爱的状态", "file": "10556389.html